{"seq":2,"slug":"type-projections","title":"类型投影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/type-projections","wordCount":654,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型投影\">类型投影</h1><p>类型投影（Type Projections）是 Kotlin 在使用处限制泛型类型读写能力的机制。当泛型类在声明时未标注型变（即不变），但某些使用场景只需要读取或写入时，类型投影能提供更灵活的类型安全保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>类型投影的核心是：<strong>在不修改泛型类声明的前提下，于使用处限制其读写能力</strong>。对不变的 <code>Array&lt;T&gt;</code>，<code>Array&lt;out Any&gt;</code> 只允许读取（生产者角色），<code>Array&lt;in String&gt;</code> 只允许写入（消费者角色），编译器据此在保留类型安全的同时放开子类型转换。它与声明处型变解决同一问题，区别只在于约束标注的位置。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"不变类型的困境\">不变类型的困境</h2><p><code>Array&lt;T&gt;</code> 在 Kotlin 中是不变的——<code>Array&lt;String&gt;</code> 既不是 <code>Array&lt;Any&gt;</code> 的子类型，也不是其父类型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun copy(from: Array&lt;Any&gt;, to: Array&lt;Any&gt;) {&#10;    for (i in from.indices) to[i] = from[i]&#10;}&#10;&#10;val strings: Array&lt;String&gt; = arrayOf(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;)&#10;val anys: Array&lt;Any&gt; = arrayOf(1, 2, 3)&#10;&#10;// copy(strings, anys) // 编译错误：Array&lt;String&gt; 不能赋值给 Array&lt;Any&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun copy(from: Array&#x3C;Any>, to: Array&#x3C;Any>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i in from.indices) to[i] = from[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val strings: Array&#x3C;String> = arrayOf(\"a\", \"b\", \"c\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val anys: Array&#x3C;Any> = arrayOf(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// copy(strings, anys) // 编译错误：Array&#x3C;String> 不能赋值给 Array&#x3C;Any></span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种设计防止了运行时错误，但也限制了灵活性。类型投影正是为了解决这一问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"out-投影-协变投影\">out 投影（协变投影）</h2><p>使用 <code>out</code> 将泛型参数限制为只读（生产者角色）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun copy(from: Array&lt;out Any&gt;, to: Array&lt;Any&gt;) {&#10;    for (i in from.indices) {&#10;        to[i] = from[i] // 合法：从 from 读取&#10;    }&#10;    // from[0] = &quot;x&quot; // 编译错误：out 投影禁止写入&#10;}&#10;&#10;val strings = arrayOf(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;)&#10;val anys = arrayOf&lt;Any&gt;(1, 2, 3)&#10;copy(strings, anys) // 现在合法\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun copy(from: Array&#x3C;out Any>, to: Array&#x3C;Any>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i in from.indices) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        to[i] = from[i] // 合法：从 from 读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // from[0] = \"x\" // 编译错误：out 投影禁止写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val strings = arrayOf(\"a\", \"b\", \"c\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val anys = arrayOf&#x3C;Any>(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>copy(strings, anys) // 现在合法</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph out 投影&#10;        A[&quot;Array＜out Any＞&quot;] --&gt;|允许| B[读取元素]&#10;        A --&gt;|禁止| C[写入元素]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph out 投影\n        A[\"Array＜out Any＞\"] --&gt;|允许| B[读取元素]\n        A --&gt;|禁止| C[写入元素]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"in-投影-逆变投影\">in 投影（逆变投影）</h2><p>使用 <code>in</code> 将泛型参数限制为只写（消费者角色）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun fill(dest: Array&lt;in String&gt;, value: String) {&#10;    for (i in dest.indices) {&#10;        dest[i] = value // 合法：向 dest 写入&#10;    }&#10;    // val s: String = dest[0] // 编译错误：in 投影读取返回 Any?&#10;}&#10;&#10;val anys = arrayOf&lt;Any&gt;(&quot;x&quot;, &quot;y&quot;, &quot;z&quot;)&#10;fill(anys, &quot;filled&quot;) // 合法：Array&lt;Any&gt; 可作为 Array&lt;in String&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun fill(dest: Array&#x3C;in String>, value: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i in dest.indices) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dest[i] = value // 合法：向 dest 写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // val s: String = dest[0] // 编译错误：in 投影读取返回 Any?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val anys = arrayOf&#x3C;Any>(\"x\", \"y\", \"z\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fill(anys, \"filled\") // 合法：Array&#x3C;Any> 可作为 Array&#x3C;in String></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>投影类型</th>\n<th>可读</th>\n<th>可写</th>\n<th>适用角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Array&lt;out T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>✅ 返回 <code>T</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Array&lt;in T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>⚠️ 返回 <code>Any?</code></td>\n<td>✅ 接受 <code>T</code></td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Array&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>✅ 返回 <code>T</code></td>\n<td>✅ 接受 <code>T</code></td>\n<td>双向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"与-java-有界通配符的对比\">与 Java 有界通配符的对比</h2><p>Kotlin 的类型投影与 Java 的有界通配符（bounded wildcards）在概念上对应，但语法和语义更加清晰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Kotlin</th>\n<th>Java</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Array&lt;out Animal&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Array&lt;? extends Animal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>协变：只读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Array&lt;in Animal&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Array&lt;? super Animal&gt;</code></td>\n<td>逆变：只写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Array&lt;*&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Array&lt;?&gt;</code></td>\n<td>星投影/无界通配符</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Java 的 PECS（Producer Extends Consumer Super）原则在 Kotlin 中有了更直观的表达：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Kotlin 版 PECS&#10;fun &lt;T&gt; transfer(&#10;    source: MutableList&lt;out T&gt;,  // Producer: out (extends)&#10;    target: MutableList&lt;in T&gt;    // Consumer: in (super)&#10;) {&#10;    for (item in source) {&#10;        target.add(item)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Kotlin 版 PECS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T> transfer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    source: MutableList&#x3C;out T>,  // Producer: out (extends)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    target: MutableList&#x3C;in T>    // Consumer: in (super)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (item in source) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        target.add(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Kotlin 的 <code>out</code>/<code>in</code> 比 Java 的 <code>extends</code>/<code>super</code> 更符合直觉——<code>out</code> 表示数据从中流出，<code>in</code> 表示数据向其流入。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型投影的限制\">类型投影的限制</h2><p>类型投影并非万能，有以下限制需要注意：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-不能调用接受投影类型参数的方法\">1. 不能调用接受投影类型参数的方法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun readOnly(list: MutableList&lt;out Number&gt;) {&#10;    // list.add(42)          // 编译错误&#10;    // list[0] = 42          // 编译错误&#10;    val n: Number = list[0]  // 合法&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun readOnly(list: MutableList&#x3C;out Number>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // list.add(42)          // 编译错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // list[0] = 42          // 编译错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val n: Number = list[0]  // 合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-嵌套投影的复杂性\">2. 嵌套投影的复杂性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun process(map: Map&lt;String, List&lt;out Number&gt;&gt;) {&#10;    val numbers: List&lt;out Number&gt; = map[&quot;key&quot;] ?: emptyList()&#10;    // 返回类型为 Number，不会丢失信息&#10;    val first: Number? = numbers.firstOrNull()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun process(map: Map&#x3C;String, List&#x3C;out Number>>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val numbers: List&#x3C;out Number> = map[\"key\"] ?: emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 返回类型为 Number，不会丢失信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val first: Number? = numbers.firstOrNull()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-声明处型变优先\">3. 声明处型变优先</h3><p>如果类型在声明时已标注型变，使用处不能与之矛盾：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface Source&lt;out T&gt; {&#10;    fun next(): T&#10;}&#10;&#10;// fun demo(s: Source&lt;in String&gt;) { } // 错误：Source 已声明为 out\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Source&#x3C;out T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun next(): T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fun demo(s: Source&#x3C;in String>) { } // 错误：Source 已声明为 out</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[泛型类型使用] --&gt; B{声明处已有型变?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[遵循声明处型变]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要限制读写?}&#10;    D --&gt;|只需读取| E[使用 out 投影]&#10;    D --&gt;|只需写入| F[使用 in 投影]&#10;    D --&gt;|都需要| G[保持不变]&#10;    D --&gt;|不关心类型| H[使用星投影 *]\">flowchart TD\n    A[泛型类型使用] --&gt; B{声明处已有型变?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[遵循声明处型变]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要限制读写?}\n    D --&gt;|只需读取| E[使用 out 投影]\n    D --&gt;|只需写入| F[使用 in 投影]\n    D --&gt;|都需要| G[保持不变]\n    D --&gt;|不关心类型| H[使用星投影 *]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用示例\">实际应用示例</h2><h3 id=\"安全的集合复制工具\">安全的集合复制工具</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun &lt;T&gt; safeTransfer(&#10;    source: Iterable&lt;out T&gt;,&#10;    destination: MutableCollection&lt;in T&gt;&#10;) {&#10;    for (element in source) {&#10;        destination.add(element)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val ints: List&lt;Int&gt; = listOf(1, 2, 3)&#10;val numbers: MutableList&lt;Number&gt; = mutableListOf()&#10;safeTransfer(ints, numbers) // Int 是 Number 的子类型，完全安全\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T> safeTransfer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    source: Iterable&#x3C;out T>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    destination: MutableCollection&#x3C;in T></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (element in source) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        destination.add(element)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val ints: List&#x3C;Int> = listOf(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val numbers: MutableList&#x3C;Number> = mutableListOf()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeTransfer(ints, numbers) // Int 是 Number 的子类型，完全安全</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"通用比较器\">通用比较器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun &lt;T&gt; findMax(&#10;    list: List&lt;out T&gt;,&#10;    comparator: Comparator&lt;in T&gt;&#10;): T? {&#10;    if (list.isEmpty()) return null&#10;    var max = list[0]&#10;    for (i in 1 until list.size) {&#10;        if (comparator.compare(list[i], max) &gt; 0) {&#10;            max = list[i]&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return max&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T> findMax(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    list: List&#x3C;out T>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    comparator: Comparator&#x3C;in T></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): T? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (list.isEmpty()) return null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var max = list[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i in 1 until list.size) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (comparator.compare(list[i], max) > 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            max = list[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>类型投影</strong>在使用处限制泛型类型的读写能力，解决不变类型的灵活性问题</li>\n<li><strong><code>out</code> 投影</strong>将类型限制为只读（生产者），对应 Java 的 <code>? extends</code></li>\n<li><strong><code>in</code> 投影</strong>将类型限制为只写（消费者），对应 Java 的 <code>? super</code></li>\n<li>Kotlin 的 <code>out</code>/<code>in</code> 语义比 Java 的 PECS 更直观</li>\n<li>声明处型变优先于使用处投影，两者不能矛盾</li>\n<li>嵌套投影会增加复杂性，应优先考虑声明处型变简化 API</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型投影","id":"类型投影"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不变类型的困境","id":"不变类型的困境"},{"level":2,"text":"out 投影（协变投影）","id":"out-投影-协变投影"},{"level":2,"text":"in 投影（逆变投影）","id":"in-投影-逆变投影"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Java 有界通配符的对比","id":"与-java-有界通配符的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"类型投影的限制","id":"类型投影的限制"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 不能调用接受投影类型参数的方法","id":"1-不能调用接受投影类型参数的方法"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 嵌套投影的复杂性","id":"2-嵌套投影的复杂性"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 声明处型变优先","id":"3-声明处型变优先"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用示例","id":"实际应用示例"},{"level":3,"text":"安全的集合复制工具","id":"安全的集合复制工具"},{"level":3,"text":"通用比较器","id":"通用比较器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"泛型与型变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/generics-and-variance"},"next":{"title":"内联类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/inline-classes"}}